189 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this report, we will analyze the current status of Al Nahda Auto Parts' New Point accounting system, identify the most prominent shortcomings, and propose the best solutions to improve automation and accelerate system performance. The current system relies on manual processes for accounting, inventory management, and supplier communication, leading to slow price comparisons, delayed purchase orders, and consequently, wasted time, increased errors, and decreased productivity.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The proposed solution is to automate communication with suppliers when inventory levels are low. The system then receives and compares quotes, and proposes the optimal solution. This improvement ensures faster decision-making, data accuracy, and integration of financial and operational units.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
191 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Using the evaluation method, the automation feature received the highest score in terms of its effectiveness, its ability to reduce manual effort, enhance efficiency, and reduce errors resulting from manual performance, supporting the company's long-term digital transformation goals.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (1)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Introduction)
/E (Introduction)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In this project we are as a team planning to propose an enhancement for the existing accounting system which called NewPoint, many retail stores use it including the organisation that we will be writing about, they use it to manage their all financial processes and also they manage inventory and alot of processes using it. The goal of this enhancement is to address a critical issues that face alot of merchants, which include the manual and time consuming process because they need to keep track the inventory, identify products, communicating with suppliers and so on.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( )
/Pg 10 0 R
>>
endobj
196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Al-Nahdah Company current situation is : the employer or the store owner must manualy contact suppliers and write every single thing they need and send it to the suppliers and compare them to get the best deal, and all of that is time and effort consuming.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( The enhancement that we will be developing is : proposing a feature that will automate the whole workflow by sending automatic notifications to the suppliers that Al-Nahdah company dealing with whenever a shortage happen, then the suppliers can submit price offers through the system, and the merchant will be able to receive all offers in an interface and it will be easy for them to compare between them and select the best offer. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This report will give a detailed description for this enhancement and we will be applying the System Analysis and Design Concepts on it. The outline of the report is as following: Chapter 1 talkes in detail about the organisation and it's current system. Chapter 2 presents the needs assessment and problem analysis. Chapter 3 will discuss the proposed enhancement in detailed and mention the alternative solutions and evaluates them using appropriate techniques. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
