205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Al-Nahda Automotive Parts Establishment it is a small company and was founded in 2021 in Jeddah, Saudi Arabia, they are specialized in selling the parts for alot of big and small companies and also for individuals, they are not just selling for customers inside Jeddah they also target customers from all over Saudi Arabia. The company gets its strength and competitive advantage through offering a high quality products and they are all original. The company also has built its reputation on honesty, trust, and product quality, ensuring its position in the market and to make the customer satisfied through receiving original and reliable product and also good service. Over the years, Al-Nahda was able to get good partnerships with multiple car part suppliers and local workshops to meet the increasing demand for authentic components.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The company in short believes that the customer is their main reason to survive and grow so they are trying their best to enhance their operational efficiency and serve them in the best way possible to get the customer satisfaction.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
