317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The current problem with the system is that when the stock drops to the lowest level, the suppliers are not automatically notified and the employees are required to manually carry out the purchasing process step by step, starting from identifying the shortage to arrival and communicating with the suppliers, discussing and comparing prices. This process causes a delay in the stock to be refilled and places a heavy burden on the employees and puts them under constant pressure from running out of essential products.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
