<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The proposed improvement at Al Nahda Foundation focused on developing the Newpoint system by adding new automation features that will facilitate communication with suppliers and inventory management. This update will also allow the system to automatically detect issues related to low stock levels and send immediate notifications to suppliers, ensuring faster replenishment and increasing operational efficiency. In addition, the improved system will include a unified interface that allows suppliers to submit quotes directly, allowing store owners to easily compare quotes and create purchase orders instantly. This improved system will help reduce manual work and errors, and contribute to improving and developing the overall operational performance within the organization.)
/E (The proposed improvement at Al Nahda Foundation focused on developing the Newpoint system by adding new automation features that will facilitate communication with suppliers and inventory management. This update will also allow the system to automatically detect issues related to low stock levels and send immediate notifications to suppliers, ensuring faster replenishment and increasing operational efficiency. In addition, the improved system will include a unified interface that allows suppliers to submit quotes directly, allowing store owners to easily compare quotes and create purchase orders instantly. This improved system will help reduce manual work and errors, and contribute to improving and developing the overall operational performance within the organization.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
