<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (In this chapter, we analyzed the problem of the current accounting system of Al Nahda Company and used the 5 Why technique method. We started by detailing the problem, setting its objectives and issues, and setting the priority of the measure for each objective. Then, we identified the gaps and described the scope. Finally, we showed the areas of need for automation and identified the scope of improvement and the main stakeholders to ensure communication and efficient project management.)
/E (In this chapter, we analyzed the problem of the current accounting system of Al Nahda Company and used the 5 Why technique method. We started by detailing the problem, setting its objectives and issues, and setting the priority of the measure for each objective. Then, we identified the gaps and described the scope. Finally, we showed the areas of need for automation and identified the scope of improvement and the main stakeholders to ensure communication and efficient project management.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
