549 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In conclusion, the proposed enhancement to Al Nahda Auto Spare Parts' New Point accounting system effectively addresses the major operational challenges caused by manual supplier communication and inventory management. By incorporating an automated supplier communication module, the system will streamline purchasing processes, reduce errors, and improve decision-making efficiency. This automated system supports faster responses to low inventory levels and facilitates seamless quote comparisons, saving time and costs. This practical solution is technically and operationally aligned with Al Nahda's mission of reliability and innovation, enhancing its competitive advantage. Finally, this enhancement will enhance productivity, transparency, and sustainable digital transformation across the company.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
>>
